<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher. Trading was moderate. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $3.00. Top $57.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-450 lbs    44.00</p>
<p>		  some US 1-2 400-450 lbs 45.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    48.00-50.00</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    52.00-57.00</p>
</text>
